<title>USA: CBOT/CME closing trends - Oct 28.</title>
<headline>CBOT/CME closing trends - Oct 28.</headline>
<text>
<p>Wheat    dn 7-1/2  cts/bu    Live Cattle  up 0.875  cts/lb</p>
<p>    Corn     unchanged cts/bu    Feeders	up 0.075 cts/lb</p>
<p>    Oats     up 2-1/4  cts/bu    Live Hogs    up 1.425 cts/lb</p>
<p>    Soybeans up 1-3/4  cts/bu    Pork Bellies up 2.125 cts/lb</p>
<p>    Soyoil   dn 0.14   cts/lb</p>
<p>    Soymeal  up 1.30   dollar/ton</p>
<p>Commodity Research Bureau Futures Index - Oct 25</p>
